  <view class="source-intro pg10-card"><view class="intro-head"><view class="source-icon">⌘</view><view><view class="intro-title">开源许可与致谢</view><text>OPEN SOURCE SOFTWARE & SPECIAL THANKS</text></view></view><view class="intro-copy">Project IRL 的构建离不开开源社区。以下列出当前工程直接使用的部分依赖；完整许可义务以发布时依赖清单及原许可文件为准。</view></view>
  <view class="source-section">▣　引入的开源组件 <text>5 项当前依赖</text></view>
  <view class="dependency-card pg10-card"><view class="dependency-head"><view>PostgreSQL 客户端 pg</view><text>MIT</text></view><view class="dependency-maker">The PostgreSQL Global Development Group</view><view class="dependency-copy">支持服务端数据库连接与活动记录读取。</view></view>
  <view class="dependency-card pg10-card"><view class="dependency-head"><view>PGlite</view><text class="apache">Apache-2.0</text></view><view class="dependency-maker">ElectricSQL</view><view class="dependency-copy">用于本地开发和测试环境中的数据库。</view></view>
